{"id":"word:hebrew:H4910","type":"word","title":"מָשַׁל","subtitle":"H4910 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to rule","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מָשַׁל (H4910) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 82 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מָשַׁל (mâshal) means to rule First listed occurrence: 1Chr 29 12."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מָשַׁל","transliteration":"mâshal","pronunciation":"maw-shal'","strong":"H4910","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4910","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["מוֹשֵׁ֖ל","יִמְשֹׁ֥ל","מֹשֵׁ֥ל","מוֹשֵׁל֙","מֹֽשְׁלִ֔ים"],"morphs":[["HVqrmsa",20],["HC/Vqrmsa",8],["HVqi3ms",7],["HVqrmpa",7],["HC/Vqq3ms",4],["HVqi3mp",2],["HTd/Vqrmsa",2],["HR/Vqc",2],["HC/R/Vqc",2],["HVqi2ms",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to rule","usage":"(have, make to have) dominion, governor, × indeed, reign, (bear, cause to, have) rule(-ing, -r), have power.","full":"H4910. mashal III. מָשַׁל verb rule, have dominion, reign (Late Hebrew Participle id. ; Phoenician משל ); — Qal Perfect 3masculine singular וּמָשַׁל consecutive Zech 6:13 2 t., מָשָׁ֑ל Dan 11:4 , וּמָשָׁ֑ל consecutive 11:5 ; 3 feminine singular מָשָׁ֑לָה Psa 103:19 ; 2 masculine singular מָשַׁלְתָּ Isa 63:19 , וּמָשַׁלְתָּ֫ Deut 15:16 ; 3 plural מָֽשְׁלוּ Isa 3:5 ; Lam 5:8 ; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִמְשֹׁל Exod 21:8 3 t., יִמְשׁוֺל Prov 22:7 ; יִמְשָׁלֿ Gen 3:16 , etc.; Imperative מְשָׁלֿ Judg 8:22 ; Infinitive absolute מָשֹׁול Gen 37:8 ; construct מְשֹׁל Judg 9:2 +, לִמְשָׁלֿ Joel 2:17 , etc.; Participle Gen 45:26 +, etc.; — 1 human subject , rule, have dominion over ( בְּ ) Gen 3:16 ; 4:7 ; 24:2 (all J), 45:8 , 26 (E), ב תִּמְשֹׁל ׳מָשׁוֺל 37:8 (E); Deut 15:6 (twice in verse); Josh 12:5 (D); Judg 8:22-23 , (twice in verse); 9:2 (twice in verse); 14:4 ; 15:11 ; 2Sam 23:3 (Participle absolute = when one ruleth , compare Dr), 1Kin 5:1 ; 2Chr 7:18 ; 9:26 ; 23:20 ; Isa 3:4 , 12 ; 19:4 ; Micah 5:2 ; Hab 1:14 ; Jer 22:30 ; Lam 5:8 ; Joel 2:17 ; Prov 16:32 ( בְּרוּחוֺ משֵׁל ), 17:21 ; 9:10 ; 22:7 ; Psa 19:14 ; 105:21 ; 106:41 ; Dan 11:43 ; Eccl 9:17 ; rarely other prepositions: ל (c. infinitive) Exod 21:8 (E); עַלֿ Prov 28:15 ; Neh 9:37 , אֶלֿ Jer 33:26 ; with suffix Isa 52:5 ; Jer 30:21 ; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb ׳מ רָ֑ב מִמְשָׁל Dan 11:3-4 , וְעַד ֗֗֗ מִן מָשַׁל Josh 12:2 (D); absolute 2Sam 23:3 (compare Dr), Ezek 19:14 ; Zech 6:13 ( עַל location), Prov 12:24 ; 29:2 ; Dan 11:5 ; especially Participle as substantive = ruler , משֵׁלאֶֿרֶץ Isa 16:1 , עַמִּים משֵׁל Psa 105:20 ; absolute Isa 14:5 ; 49:7 ; Jer 51:46 (twice in verse); Ezek 19:11 ; Prov 6:7 ; 23:1 ; 29:12 , 26 ; Eccl 10:4 ; הַזֶה הָעָם משְׁלֵי Isa 28:14 . 2 of heavenly bodies, with בְּ Gen 1:18 . 3 of God, with בְּ Judg 8:23 ; Isa 63:19 ; Psa 22:29 ; 59:14 ; 89:10 ; 103:19 ; 1Chr 29:12 ; 2Chr 20:6 ; absolute Psa 66:7 ; מ ׳זּזְרֹעוֺ לוֺ Isa 40:10 his arm ruling for him . Hiph`il Perfect 3masculine singular suffix consecutive וְהִמְשִׁילָם Dan 11:39 ; Imperfect 2masculine singular suffix תַּמְשִׁילֵהוּ Psa 8:7 ; Infinitive absolute הַמְשֵׁל Job 25:2 ; &#8212; cause to rule ,, followed by accusative of person + בְּ Psa 8:7 (subject ׳י ), Dan 11:39 ; exercise dominion , only infinitive absolute as noun abstract the exercise of dominion Job 25:2 (attribute of God).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 29 12","keyReferences":["1Chr 29 12","1Kgs 5 1","2Chr 7 18","2Chr 9 26","2Chr 20 6","2Chr 23 20","2Sam 23 3","2Sam 23 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":82,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 29 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מוֹשֵׁ֣ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 1","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מוֹשֵׁל֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HV